+      | CompareExchangeStrong p q r s success failure =>
+        simp only [Immediate] at h
+        rcases h with rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+      | CompareExchangeWeak p q r s success failure =>
+        simp only [Immediate] at h
+        rcases h with rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+      | LinuxFence order =>
+        simp only [Immediate] at h
+      | LinuxLoad p q order =>
+        simp only [Immediate] at h
+        rcases h with rfl | rfl
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+      | LinuxStore p q r order =>
+        simp only [Immediate] at h
+        rcases h with rfl | rfl | rfl
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+      | LinuxRMW p q r order =>
+        simp only [Immediate] at h
+        rcases h with rfl | rfl | rfl
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
+        · simp [measure] <;> omega
