+-- Argument conversion happens through the ordinary unsigned C parameter.
+-- Consequently n is nonnegative and division by two terminates at zero.
+-- Keep the algorithm in shared Core so both engines execute the same logic.
+fun popcount_unsigned (n: integer): integer :=
